  <data name="textBoxDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Model Weather Data Processor Ver 3.0- Allows downloading available meteorological stations and data from the global hourly (ISD), GHCN daily, COOP Hourly Rainfall, NLDAS and GLDAS datasets.
Includes a stochastic timeseries generator.

Powered by DotSpatial, BASINS WDM Utilities and SQLite.
Contact hummel.paul@epa.gov for bugs, problems and suggestions.</value>
